{"id":"6470837a8cdd9550","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-unstable.md","title":"Relative Higgs Stability","display":"df-unstable — Relative Higgs Stability","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-unstable","aliases":["58-df-unstable","Unstable Higgs Bundle"],"display":"df-unstable — Relative Higgs Stability","depends_on":["[[58-df-Higgs-bundle.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-unstable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-unstable</span><span>Unstable Higgs Bundle</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-unstable — Relative Higgs Stability"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"df2dfa78e9bb8cbb\" href=\"?note=df2dfa78e9bb8cbb\" title=\"58-df-Higgs-bundle.md\">58-df-Higgs-bundle.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,E,\\tau_E,X,\\tau_X,r,\\theta,\\Omega,\\mathcal S,\\mu,\\mathcal I\\in V\">\\(p,E,\\tau_E,X,\\tau_X,r,\\theta,\\Omega,\\mathcal S,\\mu,\\mathcal I\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S\">\\(\\mathcal S\\)</span> is a supplied carrier of proper nonzero holomorphic subbundles, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> is their slope function together with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu(E)\">\\(\\mu(E)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I\">\\(\\mathcal I\\)</span> records <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\">\\(\\theta\\)</span>-invariance.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HiggsBundle}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{HiggsBundle}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> are from the cited dependencies.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HiggsStabilityDatum}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{HiggsStabilityDatum}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HiggsUnstable}_S,\\mathrm{HiggsSemistable}_S:V^{11}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{HiggsUnstable}_S,\\mathrm{HiggsSemistable}_S:V^{11}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}Higgs\\text{-}stability\\text{-}datum}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{HiggsStabilityDatum}_S(\\mathcal S,\\mu,\\mathcal I,E,\\theta)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(E)\\setminus\\{\\varnothing,E\\}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mu,\\mathcal S\\cup\\{E\\},\\mathbb R)\n\\land\\mathcal I\\subseteq\\mathcal S\\times\\{\\theta\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}Higgs\\text{-}stability\\text{-}datum}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{HiggsStabilityDatum}_S(\\mathcal S,\\mu,\\mathcal I,E,\\theta)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(E)\\setminus\\{\\varnothing,E\\}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mu,\\mathcal S\\cup\\{E\\},\\mathbb R)\n\\land\\mathcal I\\subseteq\\mathcal S\\times\\{\\theta\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}unstable}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{HiggsUnstable}_S\n(p,E,\\tau_E,X,\\tau_X,r,\\theta,\\Omega,\\mathcal S,\\mu,\\mathcal I)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{HiggsBundle}_S(p,E,\\tau_E,X,\\tau_X,r,\\theta,\\Omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{HiggsStabilityDatum}_S(\\mathcal S,\\mu,\\mathcal I,E,\\theta)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists F\\in\\mathcal S\\;\n\\bigl(\\langle F,\\theta\\rangle\\in\\mathcal I\\land\\mu(F)&gt;\\mu(E)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}unstable}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{HiggsUnstable}_S\n(p,E,\\tau_E,X,\\tau_X,r,\\theta,\\Omega,\\mathcal S,\\mu,\\mathcal I)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{HiggsBundle}_S(p,E,\\tau_E,X,\\tau_X,r,\\theta,\\Omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{HiggsStabilityDatum}_S(\\mathcal S,\\mu,\\mathcal I,E,\\theta)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists F\\in\\mathcal S\\;\n\\bigl(\\langle F,\\theta\\rangle\\in\\mathcal I\\land\\mu(F)&gt;\\mu(E)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semistable\\text{-}Higgs}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{HiggsSemistable}_S\n(p,E,\\tau_E,X,\\tau_X,r,\\theta,\\Omega,\\mathcal S,\\mu,\\mathcal I)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{HiggsBundle}_S(p,E,\\tau_E,X,\\tau_X,r,\\theta,\\Omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{HiggsStabilityDatum}_S(\\mathcal S,\\mu,\\mathcal I,E,\\theta)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall F\\in\\mathcal S\\;\n\\bigl(\\langle F,\\theta\\rangle\\in\\mathcal I\\to\\mu(F)\\leq\\mu(E)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semistable\\text{-}Higgs}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{HiggsSemistable}_S\n(p,E,\\tau_E,X,\\tau_X,r,\\theta,\\Omega,\\mathcal S,\\mu,\\mathcal I)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{HiggsBundle}_S(p,E,\\tau_E,X,\\tau_X,r,\\theta,\\Omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{HiggsStabilityDatum}_S(\\mathcal S,\\mu,\\mathcal I,E,\\theta)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall F\\in\\mathcal S\\;\n\\bigl(\\langle F,\\theta\\rangle\\in\\mathcal I\\to\\mu(F)\\leq\\mu(E)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The candidate-subbundle family, slope map, and invariance relation are explicit data. No undefined degree, rank, or invariant-subbundle predicate remains.</li>\n<li>Once upstream holomorphic-subbundle and degree atoms exist, they can certify <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S\">\\(\\mathcal S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I\">\\(\\mathcal I\\)</span> without changing the stability inequalities.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Simpson, Constructing variations of Hodge structure using Yang–Mills theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-Higgs-bundle.md","status":"resolved","id":"df2dfa78e9bb8cbb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-Higgs-bundle.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"p,E,\\tau_E,X,\\tau_X,r,\\theta,\\Omega,\\mathcal S,\\mu,\\mathcal I\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu(E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal I","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HiggsBundle}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HiggsStabilityDatum}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HiggsUnstable}_S,\\mathrm{HiggsSemistable}_S:V^{11}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}Higgs\\text{-}stability\\text{-}datum}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{HiggsStabilityDatum}_S(\\mathcal S,\\mu,\\mathcal I,E,\\theta)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(E)\\setminus\\{\\varnothing,E\\}\\\\\n&{}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mu,\\mathcal S\\cup\\{E\\},\\mathbb R)\n\\land\\mathcal I\\subseteq\\mathcal S\\times\\{\\theta\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}unstable}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{HiggsUnstable}_S\n(p,E,\\tau_E,X,\\tau_X,r,\\theta,\\Omega,\\mathcal S,\\mu,\\mathcal I)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{HiggsBundle}_S(p,E,\\tau_E,X,\\tau_X,r,\\theta,\\Omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{HiggsStabilityDatum}_S(\\mathcal S,\\mu,\\mathcal I,E,\\theta)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\exists F\\in\\mathcal S\\;\n\\bigl(\\langle F,\\theta\\rangle\\in\\mathcal I\\land\\mu(F)>\\mu(E)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semistable\\text{-}Higgs}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{HiggsSemistable}_S\n(p,E,\\tau_E,X,\\tau_X,r,\\theta,\\Omega,\\mathcal S,\\mu,\\mathcal I)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{HiggsBundle}_S(p,E,\\tau_E,X,\\tau_X,r,\\theta,\\Omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{HiggsStabilityDatum}_S(\\mathcal S,\\mu,\\mathcal I,E,\\theta)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall F\\in\\mathcal S\\;\n\\bigl(\\langle F,\\theta\\rangle\\in\\mathcal I\\to\\mu(F)\\leq\\mu(E)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal I","display":false}],"bytes":2460,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1358","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-unstable.md|58-df-unstable]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["df2dfa78e9bb8cbb","36d7463d215be751"]}